;; D, the Ringing Stair. H's lift comes up columns 21-23 to the roof (row
;; 1); step west off it onto the sheltered rest (16-20, row 3), the top of
;; the old steps, which go down west to the gallery floor and C (rows 4-5).
;; Release jump in the column to sink back to H.
(room
  region: underhum
  at: (7 4)
  title: "The Ringing Stair"
  intent: "the rising light from below sets you down on old steps at the top of the chamber's wall"
  bed: (hum 0.7 air 0.6 water 0)
  light: 0.2
  grid:
  ("#########################"
   "#######              ^^^#"
   "####                 ^^^#"
   "#                    ^^^#"
   "                #####^^^#"
   "            #########^^^#"
   "#####################^^^#"
   "#####################^^^#"
   "#####################^^^#"
   "#####################^^^#"
   "#####################^^^#")
  decor: auto)
